<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Boston Chicken cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Boston Chicken cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Boston Chicken Inc to neutral from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- On Monday, Boston Chicken said it will cut 115 jobs or 23 percent of its workforce at its Golden, Colo., headquarters. The company will take a pre-tax, severance-related charge of about $4 million in the second quarter. The restaurant chain also said it may slow its current plan to open 300 stores in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Boston Chicken remained unchanged at 16-1/8 in early morning trading.</p>
</text>
